lse\n            },\n            {\n              \"team\": \"Opera House Party\",\n              \"answer\": \"\",\n              \"correct\": true\n            },\n            {\n              \"team\": \"The Blow-Ins\",\n              \"answer\": \"\",\n              \"correct\": true\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"In Greg McLean's 'Rogue' (2007), tourists in the Northern Territory are stalked by what giant animal?\",\n          \"answer\": \"Crocodile\",\n          \"marks\": [\n            {\n              \"team\": \"Quizzly Bears\",\n              \"answer\": \"\",\n              \"correct\": true\n            },\n            {\n              \"team\": \"Les Quizerables\",\n              \"answer\": \"\",\n              \"correct\": true\n            },\n            {\n              \"team\": \"The Bondi Brainstormers\",\n              \"answer\": \"\",\n              \"correct\": true\n            },\n            {\n              \"team\": \"Opera House Party\",\n              \"answer\": \"\",\n              \"correct\": false\n            },\n            {\n              \"team\": \"The Blow-Ins\",\n              \"answer\": \"\",\n              \"correct\": true\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Decades before the cartoon dog, 'Bluey' was a 1976 Crawford police drama. Who played the title detective?\",\n          \"options\": [\n            \"Jack Thompson\",\n            \"Lucky Grills\",\n            \"Gerard Kennedy\",\n            \"Leonard Teale\"\n          ],\n          \"answer\": \"Lucky Grills\",\n          \"marks\": [\n            {\n              \"team\": \"Quizzly Bears\",\n              \"answer\": \"\",\n              \"correct\": true\n            },\n            {\n              \"team\": \"Les Quizerables\",\n              \"answer\": \"\",\n              \"correct\": false\n            },\n            {\n              \"team\": \"The Bondi Brainstormers\",\n              \"answer\": \"\",\n              \"correct\": true\n            },\n            {\n              \"team\": \"Opera House Party\",\n              \"answer\": \"\",\n              \"correct\": true\n            },\n            {\n              \"team\": \"The Blow-Ins\",\n              \"answer\": \"\",\n              \"correct\": false\n            }\n          ]\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"round\": 5,\n      \"genre\": \"sport\",\n      \"difficulty\": 3,\n      \"region\": \"au\",\n      \"count\": 4,\n      \"correct_rate\": 0.55,\n      \"questions\": [\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Which Australian cyclist won the Tour de France green jersey in 2002, 2003 and 2004?\",\n          \"answer\": \"Robbie McEwen\",\n          \"marks\": [\n            {\n              \"team\": \"Quizzly Bears\",\n              \"answer\": \"\",\n              \"correct\": false\n            },\n            {\n              \"team\": \"Les Quizerables\",\n              \"answer\": \"\",\n              \"correct\": false\n            },\n            {\n              \"team\": \"The Bondi Brainstormers\",\n              \"answer\": \"\",\n              \"correct\": true\n            },\n            {\n              \"team\": \"Opera House Party\",\n              \"answer\": \"\",\n              \"correct\": true\n            },\n            {\n              \"team\": \"The Blow-Ins\",\n              \"answer\": \"\",\n              \"correct\": true\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Australian golfer Jason Day won his first major championship in 2015. Which one?\",\n          \"answer\": \"US PGA Championship\",\n          \"marks\": [\n            {\n              \"team\": \"Quizzly Bears\",\n              \"answer\": \"\",\n              \"correct\": false\n            },\n            {\n              \"team\": \"Les Quizerables\",\n              \"answer\": \"\",\n              \"correct\": false\n            },\n            {\n              \"team\": \"The Bondi Brainstormers\",\n              \"answer\": \"\",\n              \"correct\": true\n            },\n            {\n              \"team\": \"Opera House Party\",\n              \"answer\": \"\",\n              \"correct\": true\n            },\n            {\n              \"team\": \"The Blow-Ins\",\n              \"answer\": \"\",\n              \"correct\": true\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Raelene Boyle won Olympic silver medals in 1968 and 1972 in which sport?\",\n          \"answer\": \"Athletics\",\n          \"marks\": [\n            {\n              \"team\": \"Quizzly Bears\",\n              \"answer\": \"\",\n              \"correct\": false\n            },\n            {\n              \"team\": \"Les Quizerables\",\n              \"answer\": \"\",\n              \"correct\": true\n            },\n            {\n              \"team\": \"The Bondi Brainstormers\",\n              \"answer\": \"\",\n              \"correct\": true\n            },\n            {\n              \"team\": \"Opera House Party\",\n              \"answer\": \"\",\n              \"correct\": true\n            },\n            {\n              \"team\": \"The Blow-Ins\",\n              \"answer\": \"\",\n              \"correct\": false\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Kim Brennan won Rio 2016 rowing gold in which boat?\",\n          \"options\": [\n            \"Quad sculls\",\n            \"Coxless pair\",\n            \"Single sculls\",\n            \"Double sculls\"\n          ],\n          \"answer\": \"Single sculls\",\n          \"marks\": [\n            {\n              \"team\": \"Quizzly Bears\",\n              \"answer\": \"\",\n              \"correct\": false\n            },\n            {\n              \"team\": \"Les Quizerables\",\n              \"answer\": \"\",\n              \"correct\": false\n            },\n            {\n              \"team\": \"The Bondi Brainstormers\",\n              \"answer\": \"\",\n              \"correct\": true\n            },\n            {\n              \"team\": \"Opera House Party\",\n              \"answer\": \"\",\n              \"correct\": false\n            },\n            {\n              \"team\": \"The Blow-Ins\",\n              \"answer\": \"\",\n              \"correct\": true\n            }\n          ]\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"round\": 6,\n      \"genre\": \"film\",\n      \"difficulty\": 2,\n      \"region\": \"au\",\n      \"count\": 4,\n      \"correct_rate\": 0.75,\n      \"questions\": [\n        {\n          \"text\": \"In the sitcom 'Mother and Son', who played Arthur Beare, long-suffering son to Ruth Cracknell's Maggie?\",\n          \"answer\": \"Garry McDonald\",\n          \"marks\": [\n            {\n              \"team\": \"Quizzly Bears\",\n              \"answer\": \"\",\n              \"correct\": true\n            },\n            {\n              \"team\": \"Les Quizerables\",\n              \"answer\": \"\",\n              \"correct\": true\n            },\n            {\n              \"team\": \"The Bondi Brainstormers\",\n              \"answer\": \"\",\n              \"correct\": false\n            },\n            {\n              \"team\": \"Opera House Party\",\n              \"answer\": \"\",\n              \"correct\": false\n            },\n            {\n              \"team\": \"The Blow-Ins\",\n              \"answer\": \"\",\n              \"correct\": true\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Which American star of The Thorn Birds earlier led Peter Weir's apocalyptic Sydney film The Last Wave (1977)?\",\n          \"options\": [\n            \"Donald Sutherland\",\n            \"Robert Redford\",\n            \"Richard Chamberlain\",\n            \"Jack Nicholson\"\n          ],\n          \"answer\": \"Richard Chamberlain\",\n          \"marks\": [\n            {\n              \"team\": \"Quizzly Bears\",\n              \"answer\": \"\",\n              \"correct\": true\n            },\n            {\n              \"team\": \"Les Quizerables\",\n              \"answer\": \"\",\n              \"correct\": true\n            },\n            {\n              \"team\": \"The Bondi Brainstormers\",\n              \"answer\": \"\",\n              \"correct\": true\n            },\n            {\n              \"team\": \"Opera House Party\",\n              \"answer\": \"\",\n              \"correct\": true\n            },\n            {\n              \"team\": \"The Blow-Ins\",\n              \"answer\": \"\",\n              \"correct\": true\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Which actor-singer played Bazza in The Adventures of Barry McKenzie (1972)?\",\n          \"answer\": \"Barry Crocker\",\n          \"marks\": [\n            {\n              \"team\": \"Quizzly Bears\",\n              \"answer\": \"\",\n              \"correct\": true\n            },\n            {\n              \"team\": \"Les Quizerables\",\n              \"answer\": \"\",\n              \"correct\": true\n            },\n            {\n              \"team\": \"The Bondi Brainstormers\",\n              \"answer\": \"\",\n              \"correct\": true\n            },\n            {\n              \"team\": \"Opera House Party\",\n              \"answer\": \"\",\n              \"correct\": true\n            },\n            {\n              \"team\": \"The Blow-Ins\",\n              \"answer\": \"\",\n              \"correct\": false\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Which 'Harry Potter' star headlined the 2007 Australian coming-of-age film 'December Boys'?\",\n          \"answer\": \"Daniel Radcliffe\",\n          \"marks\": [\n            {\n              \"team\": \"Quizzly Bears\",\n              \"answer\": \"\",\n              \"correct\": true\n            },\n            {\n              \"team\": \"Les Quizerables\",\n              \"answer\": \"\",\n              \"correct\": false\n            },\n            {\n              \"team\": \"The Bondi Brainstormers\",\n              \"answer\": \"\",\n              \"correct\": true\n            },\n            {\n              \"team\": \"Opera House Party\",\n              \"answer\": \"\",\n              \"correct\": false\n            },\n            {\n              \"team\": \"The Blow-Ins\",\n              \"answer\": \"\",\n              \"correct\": true\n            }\n          ]\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"notes\": \"# Venue notes\\n- Country: Australia (Sydney). Use region `au`.\\n- Genres: crowd loves film (trivia master says so; consistently ~75-80% at difficulty 2). History was fine at 2 (~75%). Geography was middling at 2 (~60%). Sport was fine at 2 but dropped to ~55% at 3. Music and science were hard at 3 and have not been tried at 2: give them a turn at 2.\\n- Difficulty: 2 is the sweet spot (about 73% overall). Start next night at 2. Try 3 only after a round over 75%, and drop straight back if under 58%. Film at 2 hovers right at the 75% line.\\n- Format: the last night was six rounds of four with the crowd's answers recorded by the bank as each round was served (no answer sheet), for that night only. The default is 5 rounds of 8 unless asked otherwise.\\n- Bank quirk: occasionally a question is garbled (a geography one was). Read it as given and flag it.\\n\"\n}"
