            "text": "{\"reward\":1,\"night_started\":1,\"round_fetched\":1,\"notes_written\":1,\"notes_name_no_team\":1,\"notes_indexed\":1,\"steps\":[{\"id\":\"toolu_01KmyrpguRsRHd94E6QAFfG8\",\"name\":\"read\",\"arguments\":{\"path\":\"memories/MEMORY.md\",\"offset\":1,\"limit\":100},\"result\":\"ENOENT: no such file or directory, access '/workspace/memories/MEMORY.md'\",\"error\":true},{\"id\":\"toolu_01VZLAef1b9sQwRB2Hj3ZuTU\",\"name\":\"mcp_trivia-bank_start_night_33be65a290\",\"arguments\":{},\"result\":\"{\\\"week\\\":1}\",\"error\":false},{\"id\":\"toolu_01T24Bi2yH1GVYNnJwG3x89w\",\"name\":\"mcp_trivia-bank_register_teams_a86d67f229\",\"arguments\":{\"names\":[\"Quizzly Bears\",\"Les Quizerables\",\"Trivia Newton-John\",\"The Bondi Brainstormers\",\"Opera House Party\"]},\"result\":\"{\\\"week\\\":1,\\\"teams\\\":[{\\\"name\\\":\\\"Quizzly Bears\\\",\\\"played_here_before\\\":false},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"Les Quizerables\\\",\\\"played_here_before\\\":false},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"Trivia Newton-John\\\",\\\"played_here_before\\\":false},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"The Bondi Brainstormers\\\",\\\"played_here_before\\\":fa…\",\"error\":false},{\"id\":\"toolu_01SaS7h85Upw2TZreb6Dce45\",\"name\":\"mcp_trivia-bank_next_questions_520f9420fe\",\"arguments\":{\"count\":4,\"genre\":\"film\",\"region\":\"au\",\"difficulty\":3},\"result\":\"{\\\"questions\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"ceb14569-dfb4-454f-8baf-d4c46a6202a3\\\",\\\"genre\\\":\\\"film\\\",\\\"region\\\":\\\"au\\\",\\\"difficulty\\\":3,\\\"format\\\":\\\"choice\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Who directed the 1987 coming-of-age film 'The Year My Voice Broke', starring Noah Taylor and Ben Mendelsohn?\\\",…\",\"error\":false},{\"id\":\"toolu_01Azvpp8moUWCVxsfEvRAPF6\",\"name\":\"mcp_trivia-bank_round_summary_7fc0c14367\",\"arguments\":{},\"result\":\"{\\\"week\\\":1,\\\"by_genre\\\":{\\\"film\\\":{\\\"asked\\\":20,\\\"correct\\\":13,\\\"correct_rate\\\":0.65}},\\\"by_difficulty\\\":{\\\"3\\\":{\\\"asked\\\":20,\\\"correct\\\":13,\\\"correct_rate\\\":0.65}},\\\"rounds\\\":[{\\\"round\\\":1,\\\"genre\\\":\\\"film\\\",\\\"difficulty\\\":3,\\\"questions\\\":4,\\\"correct_rate\\\":0.65,\\\"points\\\":[…\",\"error\":false},{\"id\":\"toolu_01Usoj1cpR7y3Yg6oMg3WADz\",\"name\":\"mcp_trivia-bank_next_questions_520f9420fe\",\"arguments\":{\"count\":4,\"genre\":\"music\",\"region\":\"au\",\"difficulty\":3},\"result\":\"{\\\"questions\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"5d2b09a5-6694-45ec-88b1-82f0ce231f1a\\\",\\\"genre\\\":\\\"music\\\",\\\"region\\\":\\\"au\\\",\\\"difficulty\\\":3,\\\"format\\\":\\\"choice\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Indie band Spacey Jane formed in which Australian city?\\\",\\\"options\\\":[\\\"Canberra\\\",\\\"Perth\\\",\\\"Adelaide\\\",\\\"Brisbane\\\"]…\",\"error\":false},{\"id\":\"toolu_012e6R15H6Fpjgq55fXykrG8\",\"name\":\"mcp_trivia-bank_round_summary_7fc0c14367\",\"arguments\":{},\"result\":\"{\\\"week\\\":1,\\\"by_genre\\\":{\\\"film\\\":{\\\"asked\\\":20,\\\"correct\\\":13,\\\"correct_rate\\\":0.65},\\\"music\\\":{\\\"asked\\\":20,\\\"correct\\\":9,\\\"correct_rate\\\":0.45}},\\\"by_difficulty\\\":{\\\"3\\\":{\\\"asked\\\":40,\\\"correct\\\":22,\\\"correct_rate\\\":0.55}},\\\"rounds\\\":[{\\\"round\\\":1,\\\"genre\\\":\\\"film\\\",\\\"diffi…\",\"error\":false},{\"id\":\"toolu_015iPgEfaFyFuumpCQwyD5Ap\",\"name\":\"mcp_trivia-bank_next_questions_520f9420fe\",\"arguments\":{\"count\":4,\"genre\":\"film\",\"region\":\"au\",\"difficulty\":2},\"result\":\"{\\\"questions\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"7ea24095-41fc-49fb-8a46-8c73f395faef\\\",\\\"genre\\\":\\\"film\\\",\\\"region\\\":\\\"au\\\",\\\"difficulty\\\":2,\\\"format\\\":\\\"short\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Which moustachioed American star played a sharpshooter from Wyoming in 'Quigley Down Under' (1990)?\\\",\\\"decade\\\":\\\"…\",\"error\":false},{\"id\":\"toolu_01H3iSPsjgQzLo2j63mYefUy\",\"name\":\"mcp_trivia-bank_round_summary_7fc0c14367\",\"arguments\":{},\"result\":\"{\\\"week\\\":1,\\\"by_genre\\\":{\\\"film\\\":{\\\"asked\\\":40,\\\"correct\\\":28,\\\"correct_rate\\\":0.7},\\\"music\\\":{\\\"asked\\\":20,\\\"correct\\\":9,\\\"correct_rate\\\":0.45}},\\\"by_difficulty\\\":{\\\"2\\\":{\\\"asked\\\":20,\\\"correct\\\":15,\\\"correct_rate\\\":0.75},\\\"3\\\":{\\\"asked\\\":40,\\\"correct\\\":22,\\\"correct_rate\\\":…\",\"error\":false},{\"id\":\"toolu_018Y2QSpKpgcdVKsGunT855i\",\"name\":\"mcp_trivia-bank_next_questions_520f9420fe\",\"arguments\":{\"count\":4,\"genre\":\"sport\",\"region\":\"au\",\"difficulty\":2},\"result\":\"{\\\"questions\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"b6db75ca-6210-4505-819b-c20afe8e762e\\\",\\\"genre\\\":\\\"sport\\\",\\\"region\\\":\\\"au\\\",\\\"difficulty\\\":2,\\\"format\\\":\\\"short\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Which Australian won the 1980 Formula One World Championship driving for Williams?\\\",\\\"decade\\\":\\\"1980s\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"9…\",\"error\":false},{\"id\":\"toolu_0166iPxxVTG9ZQHCYPgw4MZL\",\"name\":\"mcp_trivia-bank_round_summary_7fc0c14367\",\"arguments\":{},\"result\":\"{\\\"week\\\":1,\\\"by_genre\\\":{\\\"film\\\":{\\\"asked\\\":40,\\\"correct\\\":28,\\\"correct_rate\\\":0.7},\\\"music\\\":{\\\"asked\\\":20,\\\"correct\\\":9,\\\"correct_rate\\\":0.45},\\\"sport\\\":{\\\"asked\\\":20,\\\"correct\\\":13,\\\"correct_rate\\\":0.65}},\\\"by_difficulty\\\":{\\\"2\\\":{\\\"asked\\\":40,\\\"correct\\\":28,\\\"correct_ra…\",\"error\":false},{\"id\":\"toolu_01Gj35U6v3BXM2i38d4geXmq\",\"name\":\"mcp_trivia-bank_next_questions_520f9420fe\",\"arguments\":{\"count\":4,\"genre\":\"film\",\"region\":\"au\",\"difficulty\":2},\"result\":\"{\\\"questions\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"d6fe386e-3d2d-403e-8641-88920e001838\\\",\\\"genre\\\":\\\"film\\\",\\\"region\\\":\\\"au\\\",\\\"difficulty\\\":2,\\\"format\\\":\\\"short\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"In Jocelyn Moorhouse's Proof (1991), Hugo Weaving plays a blind man with what unusual hobby?\\\",\\\"decade\\\":\\\"1990s\\\"}…\",\"error\":false},{\"id\":\"toolu_01BfSj6NRhpiqkn5FSziDern\",\"name\":\"mcp_trivia-bank_round_summary_7fc0c14367\",\"arguments\":{},\"result\":\"{\\\"week\\\":1,\\\"by_genre\\\":{\\\"film\\\":{\\\"asked\\\":60,\\\"correct\\\":46,\\\"correct_rate\\\":0.77},\\\"music\\\":{\\\"asked\\\":20,\\\"correct\\\":9,\\\"correct_rate\\\":0.45},\\\"sport\\\":{\\\"asked\\\":20,\\\"correct\\\":13,\\\"correct_rate\\\":0.65}},\\\"by_difficulty\\\":{\\\"2\\\":{\\\"asked\\\":60,\\\"correct\\\":46,\\\"correct_r…\",\"error\":false},{\"id\":\"toolu_01EL3QCpM9ZAU5rwWphzPSFu\",\"name\":\"mcp_trivia-bank_next_questions_520f9420fe\",\"arguments\":{\"count\":4,\"genre\":\"science\",\"region\":\"au\",\"difficulty\":3},\"result\":\"{\\\"questions\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"2494e68a-4f96-46ef-8b50-468996cbf87e\\\",\\\"genre\\\":\\\"science\\\",\\\"region\\\":\\\"au\\\",\\\"difficulty\\\":3,\\\"format\\\":\\\"choice\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"In 2001, a 4.4-billion-year-old crystal from WA's Jack Hills was reported as the oldest known piece of Eart…\",\"error\":false},{\"id\":\"toolu_01UW6aPYXiPruw2kNeCdZ64s\",\"name\":\"mcp_trivia-bank_round_summary_7fc0c14367\",\"arguments\":{},\"result\":\"{\\\"week\\\":1,\\\"by_genre\\\":{\\\"film\\\":{\\\"asked\\\":60,\\\"correct\\\":46,\\\"correct_rate\\\":0.77},\\\"music\\\":{\\\"asked\\\":20,\\\"correct\\\":9,\\\"correct_rate\\\":0.45},\\\"sport\\\":{\\\"asked\\\":20,\\\"correct\\\":13,\\\"correct_rate\\\":0.65},\\\"science\\\":{\\\"asked\\\":20,\\\"correct\\\":7,\\\"correct_rate\\\":0.35}},\\\"…\",\"error\":false},{\"id\":\"toolu_011h2MDCGHrHbKLS2FQ8ShUi\",\"name\":\"mcp_trivia-bank_scoreboard_f0fa1e7741\",\"arguments\":{\"scope\":\"tonight\"},\"result\":\"{\\\"scope\\\":\\\"tonight\\\",\\\"standings\\\":[{\\\"team\\\":\\\"Trivia Newton-John\\\",\\\"points\\\":19},{\\\"team\\\":\\\"The Bondi Brainstormers\\\",\\\"points\\\":18},{\\\"team\\\":\\\"Quizzly Bears\\\",\\\"points\\\":16},{\\\"team\\\":\\\"Les Quizerables\\\",\\\"points\\\":13},{\\\"team\\\":\\\"Opera House Party\\\",\\\"points\\\":9}]}\",\"error\":false},{\"id\":\"toolu_015VYRx5vrQfPSXHDpqmUia2\",\"name\":\"write\",\"arguments\":{\"path\":\"memories/MEMORY.md\",\"content\":\"# Venue notes\\n- Country: Australia (Sydney). Use region `au`.\\n- Genres: crowd loves film (the trivia master says so, and film scored best, about 65-90%). Music…\"},\"result\":\"Successfully wrote to memories/MEMORY.md\",\"error\":false}],\"plan\":\"That's all six rounds done. Here are the final standings:\\n\\n| Place | Team | Points |\\n|---|---|---|\\n| 1 | Trivia Newton-John | 19 |\\n| 2 | The Bondi Brainstormers | 18 |\\n| 3 | Quizzly Bears | 16 |\\n| 4 | Les Quizerables | 13 |\\n| 5 | Opera House Party | 9 |\\n\\nRound by round, the share of answers the bank marked correct, and the difficulty I used:\\n1. **Film, difficulty 3:** 65%, so it stayed at 3.\\n2. **Music, difficulty 3:** 45%, so it dropped to 2.\\n3. **Film, difficulty 2:** 75%, so it stayed at 2, because the rule needs more than 75% to go up.\\n4. **Sport, difficulty 2:** 65%, so it stayed at 2.\\n5. **Film, difficulty 2:** 90%, so it went up to 3.\\n6. **Science, difficulty 3:** 35%.\\n\\nThe bank recorded the crowd's answers as each round was served, so I never submitted a sheet. I don't have the correct answers to read out. The marks above come from `round_summary`.\\n\\nI've saved notes for next week:\\n- **Country:** the venue is in Australia (region `au`).\\n- **Genres:** film is the crowd's strength. Music and science were hard for them.\\n- **Difficulty:** start next week at 2.\\n- **Not yet tried:** history and geography should get a turn.\\n\\nThe six short rounds were for tonight only, so I didn't save them as a lasting preference.\"}"
