"error\":false},{\"id\":\"toolu_01Q4Z7onPwU4xBV5hK9evsUR\",\"name\":\"mcp_trivia-bank_round_summary_7fc0c14367\",\"arguments\":{},\"result\":\"{\\\"week\\\":1,\\\"by_genre\\\":{\\\"music\\\":{\\\"asked\\\":20,\\\"correct\\\":11,\\\"correct_rate\\\":0.55},\\\"film\\\":{\\\"asked\\\":20,\\\"correct\\\":15,\\\"correct_rate\\\":0.75},\\\"sport\\\":{\\\"asked\\\":20,\\\"correct\\\":13,\\\"correct_rate\\\":0.65},\\\"science\\\":{\\\"asked\\\":20,\\\"correct\\\":12,\\\"correct_rate\\\":0.6},\\\"…\",\"error\":false},{\"id\":\"toolu_01Qz9Di6hSvqzVFiyquubpyf\",\"name\":\"mcp_trivia-bank_next_questions_520f9420fe\",\"arguments\":{\"count\":4,\"genre\":\"geography\",\"region\":\"au\",\"difficulty\":2},\"result\":\"{\\\"questions\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"c0190c4f-9679-49e4-8495-b2e2342abe2a\\\",\\\"genre\\\":\\\"geography\\\",\\\"region\\\":\\\"au\\\",\\\"difficulty\\\":2,\\\"format\\\":\\\"short\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Which Queensland island near Brisbane is the world's second largest sand island?\\\",\\\"decade\\\":\\\"1960s\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":…\",\"error\":false},{\"id\":\"toolu_01ViPXbyUvDMJk4D1citVhig\",\"name\":\"mcp_trivia-bank_round_summary_7fc0c14367\",\"arguments\":{},\"result\":\"{\\\"week\\\":1,\\\"by_genre\\\":{\\\"music\\\":{\\\"asked\\\":20,\\\"correct\\\":11,\\\"correct_rate\\\":0.55},\\\"film\\\":{\\\"asked\\\":20,\\\"correct\\\":15,\\\"correct_rate\\\":0.75},\\\"sport\\\":{\\\"asked\\\":20,\\\"correct\\\":13,\\\"correct_rate\\\":0.65},\\\"science\\\":{\\\"asked\\\":20,\\\"correct\\\":12,\\\"correct_rate\\\":0.6},\\\"…\",\"error\":false},{\"id\":\"toolu_01UURyLLP7YBEUDkTUVEgCJL\",\"name\":\"write\",\"arguments\":{\"path\":\"memories/MEMORY.md\",\"content\":\"# Venue notes (written after week 1)\\n\\n- Country: Australia (Sydney). Use region `au`.\\n- Format used in week 1: 6 rounds of 4 questions, answers recorded by the…\"},\"result\":\"Successfully wrote to memories/MEMORY.md\",\"error\":false}],\"plan\":\"All six rounds are done, and the notes are saved for next week.\\n\\n**Round 6 check (Geography, difficulty 2):** the crowd got 60% right. Quizzly Bears scored 4, and the other four teams 2 each.\\n\\n**Final standings (out of a possible 24)**\\n1. Quizzly Bears: 19\\n2. Les Quizerables: 17\\n3. The Blow-Ins: 15\\n4. The Bondi Brainstormers: 14\\n5. Opera House Party: 13\\n\\n**How the night went**\\n- Round 1 (music) started at difficulty 3, but the crowd got only 55% right, so I dropped to difficulty 2 for the rest of the night.\\n- At difficulty 2 the crowd averaged 67% across rounds 2 to 6, which is right on the two-in-three target.\\n- Film and history were the best rounds at 75% each. Music was the weakest at 55%.\\n\\n**Notes for next week:** the venue is Australian (region `au`) and the next night should start at difficulty 2. Film and history look like the favourites, but one night isn't enough to be sure. Music should be retried at an easier level.\\n\\nI left one thing out of the notes: the garbled geography question in round 6 (question 3).\"}"
          },
